{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-browser-tools#card-zh","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-browser-tools","commit":"0c4fc62d175f0216456647df7efd9a57db802c2a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-browser-tools**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：让 DSH Agent 操作已启动的 Chromium 浏览器。它通过本机 Chrome DevTools Protocol 连接浏览器，并向 DSH 注册网页导航、页面结构快照、点击、输入和截图工具。交互使用快照中的会话元素引用，网站访问按规则控制，配置的敏感操作可请求 DSH 原生审批；还支持按需启动本机浏览器和保存会话产物。适合希望让 Agent 读取网页、填写表单或获取截图的用户。需要 DSH、Chromium 和本地 CDP 地址，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-17","index.js:47","lib/actions.js:34-48","config.js:3"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-browser-tools#card-en","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-browser-tools","commit":"0c4fc62d175f0216456647df7efd9a57db802c2a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-browser-tools** (DSH Web plugin): connects agents to Chromium over local CDP. Tools navigate, inspect snapshots, click, type, and capture screenshots. Session references track elements; site rules and native approval govern actions. Requires DSH, Chromium, and local CDP; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-17","index.js:47","lib/actions.js:34-48","config.js:3"]}
