{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-browser-tools#feature-1","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-browser-tools","commit":"0c4fc62d175f0216456647df7efd9a57db802c2a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-browser-tools** 的功能「网页导航与快照」：在已连接的 Chromium 中打开网页，并读取可访问页面结构及带会话元素引用的快照。先导航或刷新快照，再根据最新引用操作页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-14","lib/actions.js:50-54","lib/snapshot.js:5-26"]}
